      "writtenOn": "2017-01-24T19:09:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It does not give me a happy feeling to awaken all these listeners in some random (hash) order. It seems likely that only one will win, and a deterministic order would be better. What order? I don\u0027t know.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1620,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1622,
        "endChar": 13
      },
      "revId": "3947eda6911b9bbe4f6e6e421e70cf47d8323c3f",
